@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@* A plain, centred canvas for the public page — the same feel as the design system's sign-in
   screen (LoginShell): brand + card centred on the page background, with a small footer. The
   theme follows the system / stored preference via the design system's theme.js. A user-facing
   theme control belongs in the shared auth chrome (tracked in app-foundation), not a bespoke
   one here, so the public page stays consistent with the login/setup pages. *@
<div class="public-page">
    <main class="public-main">
        @Body
    </main>

    <footer class="public-foot">
        url.shortener © @DateTime.UtcNow.Year · <a href="/Account/Login">Admin sign in</a>
    </footer>
</div>
